<title>UK: ING set warrants on central Europe/Russia basket.</title>
<headline>ING set warrants on central Europe/Russia basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products said it has issued 300,000 European-style call warrants on a central Europe and Russia stock basket. The basket includes four firms from Hungary, four from Poland three from the Czech Republic and three firms from Russia.</p>
<p>The warrants are denominated in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 PCT OF INITIAL SPOT VALUE</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $18.00</p>
<p> MATURITY	  12 MONTH		  MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
